<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About | KATOC</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css">
</head>
<body>
    <header class="app-header">
        <a href="{{ path('app_home') }}" class="app-brand">KATOC</a>
        <nav>
            <a href="{{ path('app_home') }}">Home</a>
            <a href="{{ path('app_hospitals') }}">Find a center</a>
            {% if app.user %}<a href="{{ path('app_dashboard') }}">Dashboard</a>{% else %}<a href="{{ path('app_login') }}">Log in</a>{% endif %}
        </nav>
    </header>
    <main class="app-main about">
        <h1>About KATOC</h1>
        <p class="muted">Kidney Access and Treatment Operation Center</p>
        <p>KATOC is a digital platform that helps patients and their families locate dialysis centers, read essential information about nearby facilities, and request appointments in one place.</p>
        <p>Edit this page in <code>templates/about/about.html.twig</code> to add your own team and project details.</p>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
